{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/26/0482648/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たっだいまー！( *^ω^ * )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/26/0482648/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もおずっと前に帰ってきてたけど"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/26/0482648/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"制服、さむいっ（ ; ; ）震っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっためて？( *pωq* ) ♡///"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんは風邪引いてないかなあ？\nコメントで結構インフルエンザ流行ってるって\n聞くから心配ですっ(つω<。｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さてさて、今日から\nテスト 始まりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/26/0482648/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の科目は、日本史・倫理\n体育・家庭総合の４教科でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出来ばえは..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばっちしd|｀･∀･´d|ﾃﾞｽ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんながパワー送ってくれたから\n頑張れたよお～っ(´◡`๑)\nありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/26/0482648/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/26/0482648/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあ私からも、\nありがとパワーーーうぇいおえぁ！！！！！ヽ(｡ ^ω^ ｡)ﾉﾞ ズガゴゴゴゴゴッ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"／ すごーす！すごーす^o^！ ＼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日もテストなので、\n頑張りますっ (丿^ω^ヽ) ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もPC使ってお勉強なの♪\nあ、前に、小学生のときに自分の\nPCを買ってもらって、使いすぎて親に\nネット回線切られたって言ってたのが\n昨日の相方くんです(´◡`๑) 笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、お勉強のためだから！って\nお願いして、中学のとき\n復活させてもらったんです(๑òωó๑)\n小学生のときから一緒にいる、\n大切な私のパソコンなのっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/26/0482648/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、いい子にちゃんとこのコで\nお勉強してあげなきゃ꒰๑͒ • •`๑͒꒱"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○  コーヒー好きなの？？？\nコーヒーはブラックで飲んでる?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊  まったくです（ ;  ; ）\n全然飲めないんですけど、、\n眠気覚ましにと思って...\nブラックってにがいやつですか？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はちゃんとメガシャキ\n買ってきました！(｡> <｡)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/26/0482648/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○  さゆにゃんの好きな偉人教えてー？ww"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊  フローレンス・ナイチンゲールさんです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小さい頃、ナイチンゲールさんの\n本を読んで、すごく好きになって、\nこんな人になりたいって\n尊敬して憧れていました。\n将来は、看護師さんになりたいって\n言ってました、、(´^ω^｀; )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小学生のときの文集にも、\n将来の夢は看護師さんになること\nって作文を書いてました(*∩ω∩*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰かのためになりたいって、\nその気持ちは今も変わりません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○   さゆにゃんって特別に何か風邪予防してますか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊   手洗い、うがい、消毒、マスク着用...\nあとは、マフラーや手袋をつけて\n身体を冷やさないようにしたり\nしています(*^ω^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とくに私はのどが弱いので、\n暖房とかにも気を使ってます(｡> <｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんも風邪、気をつけてね！\nでも、もし風邪ひいちゃったら、\nいつでもここにきてね(*^_^*)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんが元気あげるっ(๑>ω<๑)!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/26/0482648/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/26/0482648/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/26/0482648/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんヽ(｡･ω･｡)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/26/0482648/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/26/0482648/0011.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}